      "content": "it's easy to say \"life has value\" when you aren't the one standing there with nothing left. it feels less like a \"difficult time\" and more like an empty math equation. i spent 22 years investing everything i had into a life that doesn't even exist anymore. the math just doesn't add up. how is it supposed to have value when the return on investment is literally zero?",
